":315},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-5"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Because you're the only one saying it like everyone's already guilty."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":316},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-7"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I didn't say that."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":317},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-8"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I know you didn't use those words."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":318},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-9"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: What exactly do you want from me?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":319},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-10"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: For you to ask a question, accept an answer, and think about it before asking the same question louder."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":320},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-12"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Fine."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":321},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-13"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: One more question."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":322},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-14"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: And I'm asking you, not Sophie."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":323},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-06-15"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Why did you stay?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":324},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C07-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That I understand."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":325},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C07-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Doesn't explain what you want out of this."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":326},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C07-a-3"}},{"k":"