,{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":338},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-16"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I know."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":339},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-17"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: You invited someone without asking the rest of us."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":340},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-18"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I know that too."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":341},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-19"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Then promise you won't do it again."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":342},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-20"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I can't promise I'll never make another bad decision."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":343},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-21"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: That's not what I'm asking."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":344},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-22"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: It sounds like it."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":345},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-23"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: It can be simpler than that."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":346},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-24"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: No more sharing private things without agreement. Not until we know what we're sharing."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":347},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-25"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Okay."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":348},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-27"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Okay?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":349},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-28"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Yes. Okay."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":350},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-29"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Is there a form I should sign?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":351},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-30"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Sophie."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":352},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-31"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: Sorry."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":353},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-07-32"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I'm trying."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":354},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C08-a-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Sophie: I don't want you to leave because we can't agree on something."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":355},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C08-a-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: You can decide that yourself. Not under pressure."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":356},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-C08-a-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: I wouldn't stop you."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":357},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-1"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: I think that's enough about the invitation."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":358},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-2"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: Could we agree to stop treating possibilities like facts, too?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":359},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-3"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Lucas: Such as?"}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":360},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-4"}},{"k":"text","v":{"s":"FIND DANIEL · Maya: The timeline."}},{"k":"read","v":{"b":true}}],"id":361},{"o":[{"k":"id","v":{"s":"OPEN-S02-FINAL-AFTER-08-6"}},{